This is a WordPress plugin project.

## Scope

- Only modify files inside this plugin
- Never modify:
  - WordPress core
  - WooCommerce core
  - Themes
  - Other plugins

## General Standards

- Follow WordPress best practices
- Follow existing project architecture and conventions
- Prefer minimal, targeted changes over large rewrites

## Hooks & Extensibility

- Prefer hooks (actions/filters) over direct overrides
- Extend existing behavior instead of replacing it

## Safety

- Do not introduce breaking changes without clear reason
- Avoid side effects that impact global site behavior

## Responsibility

- Keep changes scoped to the task
- Do not assume unrelated parts of the plugin should be modified